{"id":"f28281ca315fc78c","group":"92","path":"92/92-cor-diagonal-fixed-point.md","title":"Diagonal is Fixed Point","display":"cor-diagonal-fixed-point — Diagonal is Fixed Point","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-cor-diagonal-fixed-point","aliases":["92-cor-diagonal-fixed-point"],"display":"cor-diagonal-fixed-point — Diagonal is Fixed Point","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-lem-self-reference-construction]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-cor-diagonal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-cor-diagonal-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-diagonal-fixed-point — Diagonal is Fixed Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eba4d14b343d9469\" href=\"?note=eba4d14b343d9469\" title=\"92-lem-self-reference-construction\">92-lem-self-reference-construction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (diagonal function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution and free-variable function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\)</span> (target formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\eta_\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\eta_\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span> (auxiliary formula from the self-reference construction)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\eta_\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\eta_\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner},v_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner=d(\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner),\\\\\n&amp;G\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma_\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner},v_1)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_1\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\eta_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\n\\exists\\gamma_\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\Bigl[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\eta_\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\gamma_\\theta=\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\eta_\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner},v_0),\\\\\n&amp;\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner=d(\\ulcorner\\eta_\\theta\\urcorner),\\\\\n&amp;G\\vdash\\Bigl(\n\\gamma_\\theta\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\theta,\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma_\\theta\\urcorner},v_1)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对角函数给出辅助公式经自代入后的句子码；“固定点”是最后一行的可证等价</li>\n<li>最后一行使用无捕获代入，而不是把公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>误当作接收numeral的元语言函数</li>\n<li>Gödel编号只要求有效与单射，并不保证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(n)&gt;n\">\\(d(n)&gt;n\\)</span>；原来的数值单调性结论没有依据</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-self-reference-construction","status":"resolved","id":"eba4d14b343d9469","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-self-reference-construction]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8